{"id":24238,"imdb":"tt0978762","en":"Mary and Max","orig":"Mary and Max","ar":null,"tag":"Sometimes perfect strangers make the best of friends.","ov":"في عام 1976 تعيش الطفلة (ماري) في مدينة ملبورن بأستراليا، وتحيا حياة كئيبة؛ حيث إنها ابنة (نورمان) المنعزل غريب الأطوار، ووالدتها المدمنة على الكحول، والمصابة بداء السرقة، تطلب منها المدرسة كتابة خطاب إلى شخص يعيش في نيويورك، فتختار عشوائياً (ماكس) المصاب بالسمنة المفرطة، والرهاب الاجتماعي، تنمو بينهما صداقة عميقة، يتبادلان فيها الرسائل، وتحاول (ماري) مساعدته.","rd":"2009-04-09","rt":92,"g":[16,35,18],"lang":"en","budget":8240000,"revenue":1740429,"companies":[{"n":"Melodrama Pictures","logo":null,"c":"AU"},{"n":"Screen Australia","logo":"/eGkfvvyf4fJTvBUR1xt1669IPA3.png","c":"AU"},{"n":"Film Victoria","logo":"/8oyCRYf6ezxB5h8HJIPVG8JjzgL.png","c":"AU"},{"n":"SBS","logo":"/aQ7chdTN42fz0qtmih3yYnDWp4F.png","c":"AU"}],"countries":["AU"],"langs":["English","Yiddish"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"AU","d":"2009-04-09"},{"c":"BE","d":"2009-04-09"},{"c":"IE","d":"2009-04-09"},{"c":"CZ","d":"2009-07-30"},{"c":"BR","d":"2009-09-25"},{"c":"US","d":"2009-09-25"},{"c":"FR","d":"2009-09-30"},{"c":"CA","d":"2009-10-14"},{"c":"NZ","d":"2009-11-26"},{"c":"DK","d":"2010-01-21"},{"c":"GR","d":"2010-02-18"},{"c":"NL","d":"2010-04-14"},{"c":"SE","d":"2010-05-07"},{"c":"DE","d":"2010-08-26"},{"c":"AT","d":"2010-08-27"},{"c":"GB","d":"2010-09-21"},{"c":"CH","d":"2010-09-30"},{"c":"KR","d":"2011-12-22"},{"c":"CN","d":"2025-08-08"},{"c":"MX","d":"2026-09-24"}],"dir":["Adam Elliot"],"prod":["Melanie Coombs"],"wri":["Adam Elliot"],"mus":["Dale Cornelius"],"dop":["Gerald Thompson"],"cast":[{"n":"Toni Collette","ch":"Mary (voice)","p":"/lzXRh16qe4HHeBN6tMyw0DHvaMn.jpg"},{"n":"Philip Seymour Hoffman","ch":"Max (voice)","p":"/50rqDkmvXwjwVhFH7q6ph2Rkw7S.jpg"},{"n":"Barry Humphries","ch":"Narrator (voice)","p":"/gtOAbs8ZFJiDDRPPock1qmP4V18.jpg"},{"n":"Eric Bana","ch":"Damien (voice)","p":"/l9yoDgw3YFC2gMD1HTo5djGOwSY.jpg"},{"n":"Bethany Whitmore","ch":"